-
-## 🧠 Next Steps
-\`\`\`
-${{ needs.diagnose.outputs.should_rerun == 'true' && '⏳ Waiting for rerun completion...' || '🔍 Review logs or trigger AI Auto-Fix' }}
-\`\`\`
-EOF
-
-      - name: "📤 Upload Report"
-        uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4
-        with:
-          name: "auto-debug-report-${{ github.event.workflow_run.id }}"
